AB  - This paper proposes a framework for the development of intelligent terminal system based on computer-aided creativity. The system combines virtual reality technology and Bezier curve algorithm to realize 3D visual design and interactive experience of cultural and creative products. In the algorithm design, the Bezier curve is used to generate complex and smooth curve shapes, which provides rich geometric elements for creative design of cultural and creative products. In terms of model simulation, the prototype of cultural and creative products in virtual reality environment is built, and users can preview the design effect in real time, which enhances the intuitiveness and interaction of the design. The system also introduces an intelligent recommendation algorithm, which automatically recommends design elements and styles according to users' historical design preferences and market trends to stimulate users' creative inspiration. The experimental results show that the system can effectively improve the innovation and market adaptability of cultural and creative product design, shorten the product development cycle, and provide a new technical path for the intelligent transformation of cultural and creative industry.
